    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Second: MemoryVectorIndexer now has TWO RemoveAsync overloads. RemoveAsync(scope, subject, ct) for callers that already have both parts. RemoveAsync(qualifiedName, IMemoryStore store, ct) for forget paths that only have the qualified name - it owns the ParseQualifiedName call inside its own try, so a malformed qualifiedName can\u0027t throw out of an event-sink handler with no guard (this was escalated from Minor to Important in review because PluginPipeline.ForgetAsync awaits IMemoryOperationHook.On",
