    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "Also: MemoryVectorIndexerTests.cs has a pattern for deterministically triggering VectorStoreUnavailableException in a test - seed a vectors.bin via one VectorStore instance, open a second cold-cache instance over the same dir, and hold an exclusive FileStream(path, FileMode.Open, FileAccess.Read, FileShare.None) lock for the duration of the call. Reuse this if more retry/unavailable-path tests are needed.",
